    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "a_budget", "x": 800, "y": 986, "width": 500, "height": 244, "strokeColor": "#0f172a", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300041, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "a_budget_t", "x": 816, "y": 1000, "width": 472, "height": 216, "text": "Budget heuristics (no LLM) — lib/budget.ts\n\n• CPM by income tier: mid $12 · mid-high $18 · high $25\n• monthly = $1,500 floor x #publishers x tier multiplier\n    (budget .75 · mid 1 · premium 1.25 · luxury 1.5)\n• share of budget = fitScore / sum(fitScores)\n• bid by AOV:  >= $100 target_cpa (20-35% AOV)\n    >= $40 manual_cpc (1-2%)  ·  < $40 cpm\n• targeting = personas + publisher geos + affinities", "originalText": "Budget heuristics (no LLM) — lib/budget.ts\n\n• CPM by income tier: mid $12 · mid-high $18 · high $25\n• monthly = $1,500 floor x #publishers x tier multiplier\n    (budget .75 · mid 1 · premium 1.25 · luxury 1.5)\n• share of budget = fitScore / sum(fitScores)\n• bid by AOV:  >= $100 target_cpa (20-35% AOV)\n    >= $40 manual_cpc (1-2%)  ·  < $40 cpm\n• targeting = personas + publisher geos + affinities", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300043, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.4 },
